 <h3><u>Saqiye Kausar ki Sana</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><span class=Apple-style-span arial,= sans-serif;= line-height:= normal;= border-collapse:= collapse;= color:= rgb(34,= 34,= 34);= =></span></p>
  <div>
   Saheb e Zulfikar Al Madadadain.....2
   <br>
   <br>Kam Mushkil Hai To Imdada E Khuda Kardunga
   <br>Aaj Mai Ishk Ka Tufaan Bapa Kardunga
   <br>Karne Do Mujhe Saki E Kausar (As.) Ki Sana.....2
   <br>
   <br>Raz Allah (S.w.t.) Ki Tawheed Hai Hamraz &nbsp;Ali (A.s.)
   <br>Kibriaai e Ki Dalilon Ka Hai Aagaz Ali (A.s.)
   <br>Dil Me Dil Se Jo Nikli Hai Woh Aawaz Ali (A.s.)
   <br>Aasma Saaz Zameen Saaz Bashar Shaaz Ali (A.s.)
   <br>Kare Takhllek Ba Taieed E Ahad Karta Hai
   <br>Yeh Woh Banda Hai Jo Khalik Ki Madad Karta Hai
   <br>
   <br>Karne Do Mujhe Saki E Kausar (As.) Ki Sana.....2
   <br>
   <br>Mimbar E Aalaam e Imka Ka Khateeb E Azam
   <br>Bolta Tha To Thahar Jaate The Lamho Ke Kadam
   <br>Mera Is Baat Pe Iman Hai Quran Ki Kasam
   <br>Ladkhada Ta Na Jo Kamzarf Nusairi Us Dam
   <br>Apne Hubbe daron Ko Nabio Se Badha Dete Ali (A.s.)
   <br>Ek Ek Shaks Ko Salman Banadete Ali (A.s.)
   <br>
   <br>Karne Do Mujhe Saki E Kausar (As.) Ki Sana.....2
   <br>
   <br>Wahi Jibril Bhi Laate The Yeh Eman Hai Mera
   <br>Is Ravish Par Bhi Zara Sochiea Aai Ahle Wila
   <br>Aage Sidrat Ke Farishta Yeh Nahi Jaa Sakta
   <br>Phir Yeh Quran Bhala Kiski Badaulat Pahucha
   <br>Lafz Allah (S.w.t.) Maula Mere Ban Jaate The
   <br>Jo Ali (A.s.) Kehte The Jibril Wahi Late The.
   <br>
   <br>Karne Do Mujhe Saki E Kausar (As.) Ki Sana.....2
   <br>
   <br>Jiski Marzi Hai Mukada, Woh Sikandar Hai Ali (A.s.)
   <br>Jis Se Sadir Hue Masoom Woh Mazhar Hai Ali (A.s.)
   <br>Jiska Mehkoom Hai Kauthar Woh Samandar Hai Ali (A.s.)
   <br>Jo Hai Tauheed Ka Izhar Woh Mazhar Hai Ali (a.s.)
   <br>Jo Bhi Parda Shabe Meraj Ka Sarka E Ga&nbsp;
   <br>Usko Allah (S.w.t.) Nahi Haidar (A.s.) Hi Nazar Aaienga
   <br>
   <br>Karne Do Mujhe Saki E Kausar (As.) Ki Sana.....2
   <br>
   <br>Aai Azadaron Humein Phir Se Sambhal Na Honga
   <br>Apne Kirdar Se Mahol Badalna Honga
   <br>Todkar Wakt Ki Zanzeer Nikalna Honga
   <br>Rahe Salman Pe Eman Se Chalna Honga
   <br>Hum Muhibbo Pe Jo Wa Zulm Ka Darwaza Hai
   <br>Yeh Ali (A.s.) Ko Na Samajhne Ka Hi Khamyaza Hai
   <br>
   <br>Karne Do Mujhe Saki E Kausar (As.) Ki Sana.....2
   <br>
   <br>Madh E Haider (A.s.) Me Takallum Yeh Taqaiya Kaisa
   <br>Maslehat Kaisi, Ana Kaisi, Bahana Kaisa
   <br>Aur Wakt Ke Sath Aqeade Ko Badalna Kaisa
   <br>Maut Aani Hai To Phir Maut Se Khatra Kaisa
   <br>Band Yeh Ishk Ka Darwaza Nahi Kar Sakta
   <br>Mai Ali (A.s.) Par Koi Samjhauta Nahi Karsakta
   <br>
   <br>Karne Do Mujhe Saki E Kausar (As.) Ki Sana.....2
